.TH DRAW_DEBUG_TEXT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
draw_debug_text \- Text in the built\-in 8x8 font, top\-left at x,y
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdraw.h\(dq
.BI "void draw_debug_text(float x, float y, Color c, const char *s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Text in the built\-in 8x8 font, top\-left at x,y. Always available, needs no font file and no EngineConfig.text, so it is the right tool for overlays, placeholder UI and anything drawn before fonts exist. Each character is 8 logical pixels wide and tall; the string is not wrapped or clipped.
.SH MODULE
draw (src/engine/draw/draw.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR debug_text (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
